The evidence points to one fault: the connection from ts-preserve-service to ts-order-service. I'm stopping here; the rest of the survey's signals are consistent with reduced load rather than separate faults.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-preserve-service",
      "fault_kind": "network_loss",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "log", "sql": "SELECT count(*) AS timeouts FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND message LIKE '%ts-order-service:8080%' AND message LIKE '%Connection timed out%'", "claim": "ts-preserve-service logs repeated connection timeouts on POST to ts-order-service order endpoint during the incident."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) c, round(median(duration/1e6),1) med_ms, round(max(duration/1e6),1) max_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND span_name='POST' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1,2", "claim": "Preserve outbound POST calls: 10 Error spans near 130 s median, while 72 succeed around 30 ms."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT count(*) AS order_post_server_spans FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-order-service' AND span_name='POST /api/v1/orderservice/order'", "claim": "ts-order-service served only 2 POST /order requests in abnormal window versus 130 in normal."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, attr_source, attr_destination, round(sum(value),1) s FROM abnormal_metrics_sum WHERE metric='hubble_drop_total' AND (attr_source LIKE '%preserve%' OR attr_destination LIKE '%preserve%') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Hubble drop counters show no drops on preserve pod connections, so loss is not visible at pod level in hubble."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-preserve-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) c, round(avg(duration/1e6),1) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('ts-preserve-service','ts-ui-dashboard') AND span_name LIKE '%preserve%' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2,3", "claim": "Preserve server POST spans error after about 119 s, and ts-ui-dashboard's preserve requests fail with them."}]}
  ]
}
